     "text": "Add-ons are customized extensions of Google Workspace productivity applications such as Gmail, Google Sheets, and Google Docs. Add-ons can add new capabilities to the Google Workspace applications they extend, help automate tasks, or make third-party services or information available in Google Workspace. You can see Jivrus add-ons on Google Workspace Marketplace",
