    },
    {
     "tag": "h3",
     "text": "Google Picker dialog is not opening.Why?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "17.3333px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "google-picker-dialog-is-not-opening-why"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "The Google Picker Dialog might not open because you have disabled / blocked the cookies option in you browser.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "To resolve this issue please follow below steps:",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Click the context menu in the browser toolbar to the right of the address bar.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Choose Settings.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Click Cookies and other site data in the Privacy section.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Ensure that the \"Allow all cookies\" is checked.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Now refresh the add-on",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "h3",
     "text": "I am seeing only the Help menu in the add-on. Why?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "17.3333px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "i-am-seeing-only-the-help-menu-in-the-add-on-why"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Sometimes, the add-on menus do not open fully. This could be due to slow internet connection or having too many add-ons installed.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Wait a few seconds and Open the add-on.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "OR",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Try reloading the document few times",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "OR",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Try opening the add-on in Chrome's incognito window",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "h3",
     "text": "How do I see the version# of Jivrus' add-ons?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "17.3333px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "how-do-i-see-the-version-of-jivrus-add-ons"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Click on Menu from Add-on. This will show the list of menu.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Click on About from the list of menu. This will show you the version and all other details of the add-on.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "h3",
     "text": "Why I am getting 400 code error while installing Jivrus' add-ons?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "17.3333px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "why-i-am-getting-400-code-error-while-installing-jivrus-add-ons"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Here's what might be causing the issue:",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "1. Drive Access Denied: It could be due to restricted access to certain drives or folders. Please ensure necessary permissions are granted.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "2. Admin Access: Some features may require administrative privileges. Make sure you have the necessary rights for installation.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "3. Multiple Logins: Concurrent logins to multiple accounts can sometimes lead to conflicts. Try signing out from all accounts or using incognito mode.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Follow these steps and retry the installation. If the problem persists, reach out to our support team for further assistance.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
