   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "text": "Why I am getting 400 code error while installing Jivrus' add-ons?",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "17.3333px",
   "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
   "anchor": "why-i-am-getting-400-code-error-while-installing-jivrus-add-ons"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Here's what might be causing the issue:",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "li",
   "text": "1. Drive Access Denied: It could be due to restricted access to certain drives or folders. Please ensure necessary permissions are granted.",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "1. Drive Access Denied: It could be due to restricted access to certain drives or folders. Please ensure necessary permissions are granted.",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "li",
   "text": "2. Admin Access: Some features may require administrative privileges. Make sure you have the necessary rights for installation.",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "2. Admin Access: Some features may require administrative privileges. Make sure you have the necessary rights for installation.",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "li",
   "text": "3. Multiple Logins: Concurrent logins to multiple accounts can sometimes lead to conflicts. Try signing out from all accounts or using incognito mode.",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "3. Multiple Logins: Concurrent logins to multiple accounts can sometimes lead to conflicts. Try signing out from all accounts or using incognito mode.",
   "href": "",
   "src": "",
   "alt": "",
   "size": "16px",
   "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Follow these steps and retry the installation. If the problem persists, reach out to our support team for further assistance.",
